    "pages": [
      {
        "source_page_id": "nihon-u-2025-n-unified-first-mathematics-answers-p001",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第1問　定積分の基本計算（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　絶対値の符号が変わるx=0で分ける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "最初の一手",
            "text": "積分区間−1≤x≤2の途中で|x|の式が変わるため、x=0で区間を二つに分けます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int_{-1}^{2}(x+|x|+2)^2dx=\\int_{-1}^{0}4dx+4\\int_{0}^{2}(x+1)^2dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=4+4\\left(9-\\frac13\\right)=\\frac{116}{3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　指数の微分係数2を調整する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int_{1}^{\\log2}e^{2x}dx=\\left[\\frac12e^{2x}\\right]_{1}^{\\log2}=2-\\frac{e^2}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　半角公式でsin²xを一次化する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sin^2x=\\frac{1-\\cos2x}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int_0^{\\pi/6}\\sin^2x\\,dx=\\frac{\\pi}{12}-\\frac{\\sqrt3}{8}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4)　x=3tanθと置く",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "x=3tanθと置くと、x=0,3はθ=0,π/4に対応し、分母の1+tan²θとdxの1/cos²θが打ち消し合います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nihon-u-2025-n-unified-first-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int_0^3\\frac{dx}{x^2+9}=\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\frac13d\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{12}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "基本事項",
            "text": "絶対値は符号変化点で分割、三角関数の偶数乗は半角公式、1/(x²+a²)はx=a tanθが基本です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問　直線と平方根関数・回転体（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　共有点のx座標方程式を作る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2x+k=\\sqrt{x}\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad4x^2+(4k-1)x+k^2=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "2乗した式だけで決めず、元の平方根関数との位置関係も確認します。接するときの境界は判別式D=0です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-k-range-graph",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nihon-u-2025-n-unified-first-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "D=(4k-1)^2-16k^2=1-8k",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "接する境界はk=1/8、直線が原点を通る境界はk=0です。したがって異なる2共有点をもつ範囲は0≤k<1/8です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　2解α,βを円板法へ入れる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\alpha=\\frac{1-4k-\\sqrt{1-8k}}8,\\qquad\\beta=\\frac{1-4k+\\sqrt{1-8k}}8",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-rotation-region",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V(k)=\\int_\\alpha^\\beta\\pi(\\sqrt{x})^2dx=\\frac\\pi2(\\beta+\\alpha)(\\beta-\\alpha)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V(k)=\\frac{(1-4k)\\sqrt{1-8k}}{32}\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "式整理",
            "text": "β²−α²を直接展開せず、(β+α)(β−α)にすると短く計算できます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nihon-u-2025-n-unified-first-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "x軸回転では半径が√xなので、断面積はπ(√x)²=πxです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-volume-explanation",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問　積分方程式・変曲点・y軸回転体（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　両辺をxで微分する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{d}{dx}\\int_0^x f(t)dt=f(x)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(x)=\\frac1{x+\\sqrt{1+x^2}}\\left(1+\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1+x^2}}\\right)=\\frac1{\\sqrt{1+x^2}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　二階導関数の符号変化を見る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f''(x)=\\frac{2x^2-1}{(\\sqrt{1+x^2})^5}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-convexity-table",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "x≥0で分母は正なので、分子2x²−1の符号が変わるx0=1/√2が変曲点です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nihon-u-2025-n-unified-first-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int_0^{x_0}f(x)dx=\\log\\left(x_0+\\sqrt{1+x_0^2}\\right)=\\log\\frac{\\sqrt6+\\sqrt2}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　y軸回転を横切片で積み上げる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-y-axis-rotation",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "0≤y≤√6/3では半径x0の円板、√6/3≤y≤1では曲線までの半径xをもつ円板として体積を分けます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V=\\pi x_0^2\\frac{\\sqrt6}{3}+\\int_{\\sqrt6/3}^{1}\\pi x^2dy",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "dy=f'(x)dxへ変換し、x²f'(x)を部分積分すると、元のf(x)の積分に戻せます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V=2\\pi(\\sqrt{1+x_0^2}-1)=(\\sqrt6-2)\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "別解",
            "text": "f(x)=1/√(1+x²)をxについて解き、x²=1/y²−1としてyで直接積分しても同じ値になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nihon-u-2025-n-unified-first-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{\\sqrt6}{6}\\pi+\\pi\\int_{\\sqrt6/3}^{1}\\left(\\frac1{y^2}-1\\right)dy=(\\sqrt6-2)\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "y軸回転体の一般的な二つの処理",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "積分変数をxへ変換する方法と、y=f(x)をx=g(y)へ解いてyで積分する方法があります。図形と関数形に応じて短い方を選びます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-shell-explanation",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int_a^b\\pi x^2dy=\\int_{x_a}^{x_b}\\pi x^2f'(x)dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int_a^b\\pi x^2dy=\\int_a^b\\pi\\{g(y)\\}^2dy",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "講評",
            "text": "60分・3大問の全問記述式です。第1問と第2問は基本計算を確実に取り、第3問は(1)(2)を先に回収して回転体へ進む構成が有効です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
